{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事でおめでとうコメントありがとうございましたっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思った以上にホラー苦手って方が多かったのが不安。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ皆様はなんだかんだと言いつつ観てくれるはずだと思うので！(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ねっ！？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日個握来てくれたあみあみ族さま皆様ありがとうー( *｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の服は大人っぽくてイイネって言ってくれる方いたからちょっとえへへって感じ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/03/03/3724081/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/03/03/3724081/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そういえば、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間のブログであみ言葉間違えてたみたいだね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「スノーパウダー」誤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「パウダースノー」正"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったんですね！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや～恥ずかし恥ずかし( *｀ω´) 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなパウダースノーに埋れてる写真どん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/03/03/3724081/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいでしょ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"畠中、高山、能條"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちなみにこのメンツはもちろん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO!2ではおなじみの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームヤンキー！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予告でもちらっと出ましたが、今週もやります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胸キュン企画！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームヤンキーまたやらせていただきます(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこの雪に無邪気に埋れてる感じ見るととてもヤンキーには見えない。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週もお楽しみに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そういえばもう日にち過ぎてしまいましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月1日に放送された「ガリゲル」観ていただけましたか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにあみ達はまだ見れてない～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たという方は感想を是非( *｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/03/03/3724081/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まい。らぶ"}],"source":"archive"}